edits.old:
- **Power per ToF channel.** At the §C7a central values (≈70 nJ of receive electronics and ≈0.47 µJ of laser electrical energy per ToF point):
  - receive: $15\times10^{6}\times70\ {\rm nJ}=1.05$ W, i.e. $1.05\ {\rm W}/312=3.4$ mW per macro-pixel;
  - laser: $15\times10^{6}\times0.47\ \mu{\rm J}=7.0$ W, i.e. ≈22 mW per macro-pixel.

edits.new:
- **Power per ToF channel.** At the §C7a central values (≈57 nJ of receive electronics and ≈0.36 µJ of laser electrical energy per ToF point):
  - receive: $15\times10^{6}\times57\ {\rm nJ}=0.855$ W, i.e. $0.855\ {\rm W}/312=2.7$ mW per macro-pixel;
  - laser: $15\times10^{6}\times0.36\ \mu{\rm J}=5.4$ W, i.e. ≈17 mW per macro-pixel.
